# Putting it all Together 

<img src="https://images.code.org/73700f1338f5136a047468c4bde73234-image-1761078350609.png" alt="Image CS Discoveries students" width="350px" style="border-radius:10px; float:right; margin: 0 40px 40px 40px;">

#### Now that you’ve used HTML, CSS, and AI to modify a website, it’s time to build one!

#### Think back to the four parts of the site from the last level: the navigation bar, hero section, cards, and footer.

#### In the next level, you’ll prompt the AI to create a website on a topic of your choice that includes all four parts.

