<p style="line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 10px; margin-right: 10px; margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-size: 18px; "><strong>Keep your prompts specific-</strong> for example: “Add a hero section with a large title and blue background.”
Then, tweak each section one by one until your site looks just right.
